From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: geoca <272055834+geocausa@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 15:25:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] media: qcom: camss: match SP11 VFE1 UBWC static state

Program the exact same-machine Windows VFE1 BUS UBWC static control value
before configuring and enabling the bounded E003h BUS clients.
qccamisp ownership
and the 0x1046 computation are independently proven, while consumed 0060
measured Linux at 0x00000006. No other camera programming changes.

Signed-off-by: geoca <272055834+geocausa@users.noreply.github.com>
---
--- a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-vfe-680.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-vfe-680.c
@@ -56,6 +56,8 @@
 
 /* 0060 read-only VFE680 BUS progression telemetry offsets. */
 #define VFE680_X1E_BUS_UBWC_STATIC_CTRL		0x0c58
+/* Same-machine qccamisp computes and writes this exact SP11 VFE1 value. */
+#define VFE680_X1E_WINDOWS_UBWC_STATIC_CTRL	0x00001046
 #define VFE680_X1E_BUS_PWR_ISO_CFG		0x0c5c
 #define VFE680_X1E_BUS_DEBUG_TOP_CFG		0x0cd4
 #define VFE680_X1E_BUS_DEBUG_TOP		0x0cd8
@@ -483,6 +485,10 @@
 	if (ret)
 		return ret;
 
+	/* Exact SP11 qccamisp BUS-common UBWC static programming. */
+	writel_relaxed(VFE680_X1E_WINDOWS_UBWC_STATIC_CTRL,
+		       vfe->base + VFE680_X1E_BUS_UBWC_STATIC_CTRL);
+
 	for (i = 0; i < ARRAY_SIZE(vfe680_x1e_windows_bus_client_order); i++) {
 		const struct vfe680_x1e_windows_client_contract *c;
 
